{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Eco City Planner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a sustainable city, one card at a time.</strong><br>Manage resources, plan ahead, and face environmental challenges in a strategic deckbuilder with a green vision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 Build with purpose and planning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just been appointed as the mayor\u2019s consultant for a promising, yet unexplored territory. Your mission? Build a prosperous, sustainable, and resilient city... in just 25 turns. <br>Play construction cards on a 5x5 grid to shape your city. Every card comes with trade-offs: some resources increase, others decrease. Forward-thinking is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/7a26970c1423b6b00800d9a0bfae8806.poster.avif?t=1759860595\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/7a26970c1423b6b00800d9a0bfae8806.webm?t=1759860595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/7a26970c1423b6b00800d9a0bfae8806.mp4?t=1759860595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udccf Deckbuilding with real impact</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eco City Planner blends deckbuilding with city-building tactics. Cards aren\u2019t just buildings, they\u2019re management decisions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place constructions on diverse terrains: plains, plateaus, and mountains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance gains and losses in Energy, Food, Sustainability, and Money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use action cards to convert one resource into another</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store action cards to trigger at the perfect time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/db82f74d7d60892d3cb99a215560d063.poster.avif?t=1759860595\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/db82f74d7d60892d3cb99a215560d063.webm?t=1759860595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/db82f74d7d60892d3cb99a215560d063.mp4?t=1759860595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Face the challenges of a changing world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climate and social events will challenge your city, but they won\u2019t catch you off guard. A <strong>news system</strong> alerts you 3 to 5 turns in advance, giving you time to prepare:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heatwave may drop your food production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An energy crisis will force tough decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public pressure can change your priorities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipation is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/a397df3dc1b3d877ab54326a02134d89.poster.avif?t=1759860595\" width=1286 height=724 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/a397df3dc1b3d877ab54326a02134d89.webm?t=1759860595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/a397df3dc1b3d877ab54326a02134d89.mp4?t=1759860595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf Tight gameplay, big decisions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run takes around 20 to 30 minutes, but no two cities are alike.<br>With impactful trade-offs and dynamic events, <strong>replayability is guaranteed</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>5x5 grid</strong> with terrains that affect cards and trigger events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Construction and Action cards</strong> with direct impact on resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfb <strong>News system</strong> that forecasts events and requires strategic planning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Environmental focus</strong>, with mechanics that are easy to learn but hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Quick play sessions</strong>, with meaningful decisions each turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Cute and cartoony visual style</strong>, with clear and pleasant feedback</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan. Balance. Survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eco City Planner</strong> isn\u2019t just a card game, it\u2019s a reflection on how our choices shape the cities and planet of tomorrow.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908930?t=1759860595","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908930?t=1759860595","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/e184bd0bf6fb7edb49279e6a95978bf9c56179b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759860595","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/e184bd0bf6fb7edb49279e6a95978bf9c56179b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759860595","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievem