ins: plains, plateaus, and mountains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance gains and losses in Energy, Food, Sustainability, and Money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use action cards to convert one resource into another</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store action cards to trigger at the perfect time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/db82f74d7d60892d3cb99a215560d063.poster.avif?t=1759860595\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/db82f74d7d60892d3cb99a215560d063.webm?t=1759860595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/db82f74d7d60892d3cb99a215560d063.mp4?t=1759860595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Face the challenges of a changing world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climate and social events will challenge your city, but they won\u2019t catch you off guard. A <strong>news system</strong> alerts you 3 to 5 turns in advance, giving you time to prepare:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heatwave may drop your food production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An energy crisis will force tough decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public pressure can change your priorities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipation is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/a397df3dc1b3d877ab54326a02134d89.poster.avif?t=1759860595\" width=1286 height=724 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/a397df3dc1b3d877ab54326a02134d89.webm?t=1759860595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/extras/a397df3dc1b3d877ab54326a02134d89.mp4?t=1759860595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf Tight gameplay, big decisions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run takes around 20 to 30 minutes, but no two cities are alike.<br>With impactful trade-offs and dynamic events, <strong>replayability is guaranteed</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>5x5 grid</strong> with terrains that affect cards and trigger events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Construction and Action cards</strong> with direct impact on resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfb <strong>News system</strong> that forecasts events and requires strategic planning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Environmental focus</strong>, with mechanics that are easy to learn but hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Quick play sessions</strong>, with meaningful decisions each turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Cute and cartoony visual style</strong>, with clear and pleasant feedback</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan. Balance. Survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eco City Planner</strong> isn\u2019t just a card game, it\u2019s a reflection on how our choices shape the cities and planet of tomorrow.</p>","developers":["AlienX"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908930/f0270f0b7db69c03494fcf780bc5ddabd7a9307e/header.jpg?t=1759860595","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 AlienX, 20